@startuml dagents_request_flow
title NL2SQL request flow through Dagents

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F7F3EA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Aptos"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #53635B
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #B9C2BB
  FontColor #15201B
}

actor "User" as User
rectangle "NL2SQL frontend" as UI #FFFFFF
rectangle "NL2SQL backend\n/generate" as API #FFFFFF
rectangle "Dagents planner\nsource/schema/quality\npipeline/model route" as Planner #E9E1FA
rectangle "Dagents services\ncore, pipeline,\nLMA, GMA, model" as Services #F4E8D0
rectangle "Model adapter\nCodeT5 artifact" as Adapter #DCEBE1
database "Model zip files\nmodels/*.zip" as Models #EEF3EF
rectangle "Response\nSQL + trace" as Response #DCE7F1

User --> UI : question + schema
UI --> API : POST /api/v1/generate
API --> Planner : validate and plan
API --> Services : register, profile,\ncompile workload
API --> Adapter : generate SQL
Adapter --> Models : load artifact
Planner --> API : reports and plans
Services --> API : trace evidence
Adapter --> API : SQL
API --> Response
Response --> UI : show SQL and trace

@enduml
